cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pdfnative-react, please cite it as below."
title: pdfnative-react
abstract: >-
  A declarative React renderer for the pdfnative PDF engine. JSX is compiled by
  a custom React reconciler into a pdfnative DocumentParams object and rendered
  to PDF bytes — no DOM, no headless browser, no native dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Nizoka
    email: hello@pdfnative.dev
    website: "https://pdfnative.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nizoka/pdfnative-react"
url: "https://www.npmjs.com/package/pdfnative-react"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - pdf
  - react
  - react-reconciler
  - jsx
  - pdfnative
  - document-generation
  - ai-agent
  - agentic
  - json-schema
  - sbom
  - supply-chain
version: 0.2.0
